# 统一换行符，避免 Windows/Linux 混用
* text=auto eol=lf

# Go
*.go text eol=lf diff=golang

# 二进制文件不转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary

# 视为 vendored，PR 默认折叠
go.sum linguist-generated=true
vendor/ linguist-vendored=true
